9186,"text":"大丈夫、忍の姉御が解決してくれるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[725000113]},{"nodeId":725000113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":2042851762,"text":"親分は軍事機密区域を荒らした疑いで、奥詰衆に連行された。","nextNodeIds":[725000114]},{"nodeId":725000114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":1427772178,"text":"その後、あの九条裟羅様が親分の容疑を公序良俗違反に変えたそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[725000115]},{"nodeId":725000115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30188,"speakerName":"元太","textMapHash":1670356610,"text":"くそッ！あの九条の天狗め、よくも親分にそんな重い罪を！","nextNodeIds":[725000116]},{"nodeId":725000116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":879140002,"text":"おい、バカ！これは罪が軽くなったんだよ。これなら所内で指導を受けるだけで済むはずだ…","nextNodeIds":[725000117]},{"nodeId":725000117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":3196974178,"text":"祭典のほうは、親分が出所するまで再開できないだろうけど…","nextNodeIds":[725000118]},{"nodeId":725000118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":147783410,"text":"旅人、心配しないでくれ。忍の姉御が上手いこと処理してくれる、きっと大丈夫だ。","nextNodeIds":[725000119]},{"nodeId":725000119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":4237791178,"text":"ひとまず、俺らの祭典を支援してくれてありがとな。親分が出てきたら、きっとお前のところに直接礼をしに行くはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[725000120]},{"nodeId":725000120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":2155657210,"text":"お前の旅が俺らの祭典と同じように、より良くなることを願ってるぜ。","nextNodeIds":[725000121]},{"nodeId":725000121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30189,"speakerName":"守","textMapHash":378374522,"text":"良くなることを願ってるぜ！！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7250001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_S